  title="Free Shopify Automation Stack 2026 — Replace Paid Apps" 
  description="Replace six paid Shopify apps with free tools: Meta CAPI, Google Enhanced Conversions, Stocky replacement, Klaviyo alternative, TikTok CAPI and live P&L."
>
